Negative control for the icon-only row control (D5).

Drops `icon-only` from the always-visible Button, so the declared label draws
beside the icon again — the wall of repeated words per row the ruling removed.
The tooltip and the accessible name are untouched, so what goes red is the one
claim under test: the words left the visible row.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

Reds: the icon-only specs — a row control shows its label as `sr-only` text.

